WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:12.000
Start with the part you can observe.

00:12.000 --> 00:24.000
Follow the relationship as it changes.

00:24.000 --> 00:36.000
Sensitivity analysis changes one assumption at a time to see which inputs move the result most.

00:36.000 --> 00:48.000
Recalculate the budget with material cost +10%; keep other inputs fixed so the effect is interpretable.

00:48.000 --> 01:00.000
What-if exercise

01:00.000 --> 01:12.000
These are teaching relationships, not live prices, quotes, tax advice or a forecast. State every assumption.

